# VAT → OrderWeb cloud (auto 3 AM)

## Goal
Admin sets correct item VAT → till stores real tax → Mother **3 AM** daily-report (`purpose: vat`) → cloud **VAT → Sales → POS / Return** (Box 1 / 6).  
Cashier upload stays **Reports only**. No MTD from Mother.

## Phase V0 — product rules (LOCKED)

| Rule | Locked value |
|--|--|
| Who fills cloud VAT / Return | **Only `purpose: vat`** (trigger `automatic_3am`) |
| Cashier alone | **Reports** (`purpose: operations` / `trigger: cashier`); cloud **VAT empty / not final** until 3 AM |
| Missing flags on cloud | Treated as **Reports only** — Mother **always** sends `purpose` + `trigger` |
| Till VAT vs cloud estimate | **Real till VAT preferred** (`netSales` / `vatAmount` / `grossSales` / `vatByRate`). Cloud may estimate if missing — **Mother must not rely on that** |
| Online web orders | Stay **cloud-native**; POS HMRC share = **daily Z / daily-report**, not per-ticket feed |
| Upload source | **Local POS day only** (do not double-count web into POS share) |
| Same `reportDate` twice | **One day** (restatement), not two |
| Endpoint | One API: `POST …/reports/daily` (no second VAT URL) |
| Catch-up | 7-day missing days still as **`purpose: vat` / `automatic_3am`** |
| Purchases from Mother | **No** |
| MTD submit from POS | **No** (cloud owns filing later) |
| Client → cloud | **No** (Client → Mother only; Mother → cloud for daily-report) |

### Explicit non-goals (this track)
- Do **not** turn Cashier **Upload Report** into VAT final.
- Do **not** add a manual VAT upload button on Report / Cloud Settings.
- Do **not** per-item POS transaction feed to cloud for HMRC.
- Do **not** Client→cloud or MTD from Mother.
- Do **not** invent VAT when item rates / `tax_amount` are wrong — fix till truth instead.

### Related (already exists — do not remove)
- CashierDashboard **Upload Report** → `operations` / `cashier`
- `ReportSchedulerService` 3 AM + 7-day catch-up → `vat` / `automatic_3am`
- Mother Report → **VAT** tab (local period summary)
- Payload: `netSales`, `vatAmount`, `grossSales`, `vatByRate[]`, cash/card/gift
- `OrderWebDailyReportUploadRules` purpose/trigger constants

**Done when:** rules written and agreed ✅ (this doc).

