## Phase V4 — QA (cloud HMRC self-file readiness)

Code-path review (manual till still required):

| # | Check | Expect | Code |
|--|--|--|--|
| 1 | Cashier only | Reports yes; VAT not final | `UploadCashierOperationsAsync` → `purpose=operations` / `trigger=cashier` |
| 2 | 3 AM only | Reports + VAT | `UploadScheduledAsync` → `purpose=vat` / `trigger=automatic_3am` |
| 3 | Cashier then 3 AM | One day; VAT = 3 AM | Same `reportDate`; ops does **not** clear vat backlog; vat restates day |
| 4 | 3 AM twice | No duplicate day | `WasVatFinalUploadedAsync` → skip if vat already success |
| 5 | Mixed 0% / 20% | `vatByRate` explains Box 1/6 | Scaled bands; V3 align log |
| 6 | Offline Cashier | Refuse; later 3 AM OK | Cashier refuses if cloud offline; scheduler catch-up later |
| 7 | Open orders | Refuse / defer | Cashier refuse; auto **Skipped**/defer until closed |
| 8 | Bad item VAT | Understated (fix items) | No invented VAT; soft £0 warning on tab |
| 9 | Restart Mother | 7-day vat backlog as `vat` | `GetMissingCompletedReportDatesAsync` + scheduler ~30s / hourly |
| 10 | Admin banner | Pending vs last OK (Mother); cloud shows finalised | Report `FormatVatFinalBannerText` status-only; cloud Admin UI |

**Done when:** checklist passed on real Mother + OrderWeb (manual — not ✅ until you run it).

